     A** PENNSYLVANIA - ZIP CODE/REGION FILE
     A**
     A*****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:
     A* 09/25/03 C:79 PROJ: TX020
     A*               ADD AREA FIELD TO INDICATE URBAN,RURAL, ETC
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PZR01                     TEXT('PA ZIP CODE/REGION FILE')
     A            ZRCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            ZRFZCD    R               REFFLD(ZIP1)
     A                                      TEXT('FROM ZIP CODE')
     A            ZRTZCD    R               REFFLD(ZIP1)
     A                                      TEXT('TO ZIP CODE')
     A            ZREFDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      TEXT('EFFECTIVE DATE')
     A            ZRRGN#    R               REFFLD(RGN#)
     A                                      TEXT('REGION')
     A            ZRSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A                                      COLHDG('STATUS')
     A            ZRUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINTENANCE' 'USER')
     A            ZRPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINTENANCE' 'PGM')
     A            ZRTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINTENANCE' 'TIME')
     A            ZRDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINTENANCE' 'DATE')
     A            ZRIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
     A            ZRIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
     A*** BEG ADD *** 09/25/03 ****************************************
     A            ZRAREA    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('AREA' 'RURAL/URBAN')
     A*** END ADD *** 09/25/03 ****************************************
